Hi all,

For jobs at SITE-PELLO-03 (transmission node TRN-118): the private forest road to the site
has a locked barrier about 2 km before the site. The barrier key is in the lockbox on the
barrier post, code 4471. Close the barrier again behind you.

In winter the road is ploughed only on weekdays. If it is blocked, call the landowner (number
in the site file) before driving out.

Kaisa
